<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1649264715"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Time Left"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.340"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">真是咸涩啊 第一次嗅闻舔舐到相遇的味道</text><text for="L2">自暴自弃 平均而正确的言论如此枯燥乏味</text><text for="L3">欢迎光临 添加大蒜 希望增强体质</text><text for="L4">以歌声充饥</text><text for="L5">优等生 佯装无知地起舞</text><text for="L6">这是缺点 于是为把握现状而中断</text><text for="L7">索性出让自我 向彼此炫耀心底的自卑</text><text for="L8">因为早已知晓 这是无法改变的吧？</text><text for="L9">依赖直觉自我中心 又难以理解的玩家</text><text for="L10">被这样的人追求真是桩惨案</text><text for="L11">生活因无聊的拌嘴不再那么难以忍受</text><text for="L12">还想听更多名言警句？ 可是生活已经出乎意料的艰难了啊</text><text for="L13">即使 吵闹叫嚣过 被迎面痛击过</text><text for="L14">依然坚守日常不愿退让 把每一天化作营养 沾染彼此的污迹</text><text for="L15">剩余机会未知 发不出声响</text><text for="L16">脊髓反射泪腺破防 这浑浊的声音歌唱出来的 只有感谢</text><text for="L17">好想去尝试 如此温暖</text><text for="L18">穷途末路的夜晚 竟是如此舒适</text><text for="L19">平凡的生活 我也曾梦想过</text><text for="L20">先手必胜 感觉真是不错</text><text for="L21">回家后立刻给植物浇水 种种生活琐碎</text><text for="L22">即使实际早已无比幸运 虚无感仍旧如影随形</text><text for="L23">在耳边轻声低语消解困意 你一言我一语直到血液被饮尽</text><text for="L24">多么和睦友好的时光</text><text for="L25">依赖直觉自我中心 又难以理解的玩家</text><text for="L26">既然如此穷追不舍 便给你一场余兴小聚会</text><text for="L27">感谢细致入微的指点</text><text for="L28">尽管最终 还是会目瞪口呆</text><text for="L29">即使 吵闹叫嚣过 被迎面痛击过</text><text for="L30">依然坚守日常不愿退让 把每一天化作营养 沾染彼此的污迹？</text><text for="L31">剩余机会未知 发不出声响</text><text for="L32">脊髓反射泪腺破防 这浑浊的声音歌唱出来的 只有感谢</text><text for="L33">好想去尝试 如此温暖</text><text for="L34">穷途末路的夜晚 竟是如此舒适</text><text for="L35">平凡的生活 我也曾梦想过</text><text for="L36">先手必胜 感觉真是不错</text><text for="L37">我只想要安稳的生活</text><text for="L38">虽然 我不想给别人添麻烦</text><text for="L39">可如果不战斗 就不能被抚摸了</text><text for="L40">这道理很简单</text><text for="L41">即使 吵闹叫嚣过 被迎面痛击过</text><text for="L42">依然坚守日常不愿退让 把每一天化作营养 沾染彼此的污迹</text><text for="L43">剩余机会未知 发不出声响</text><text for="L44">脊髓反射泪腺破防 这浑浊的声音歌唱出来的 只有感谢</text><text for="L45">猜拳决定想说的话 每一次惠顾</text><text for="L46">都要储存起来 直到涌起实感</text><text for="L47">没能立刻倾诉出来 不够尽兴</text><text for="L48">脊髓反射泪腺破防 顶着萎缩的大脑歌唱 十分感谢</text><text for="L49">我本就没什么干劲坐不住又肤浅</text><text for="L50">只想为一些无聊的事情欢脱傻笑</text><text for="L51">但提供的伙食填不满我的不安</text><text for="L52">爆发很累人 但不会被看不起</text><text for="L53">为满身伤痕狂欢 喜悦至极 这很健康</text><text for="L54">感觉真不错</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:50.067"><div begin="14.900" end="41.688"><p begin="14.900" end="18.391" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.900" end="15.551">しょっ</span><span begin="15.551" end="15.928">ぱい</span><span begin="15.928" end="16.221">ぜ</span> <span begin="16.283" end="16.562">初</span><span begin="16.562" end="16.789">めて</span><span begin="16.789" end="17.118">嗅いで</span><span begin="17.118" end="17.865">舐めた</span><span begin="17.865" end="18.081">出</span><span begin="18.081" end="18.391">会い</span></p><p begin="18.401" end="21.868" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.401" end="18.557">自</span><span begin="18.557" end="18.885">暴</span><span begin="18.885" end="19.347">自棄</span><span begin="19.347" end="19.756">です</span> <span begin="19.790" end="20.190">平均</span><span begin="20.190" end="20.533">的な</span><span begin="20.533" end="21.041">正論</span><span begin="21.041" end="21.266">が</span><span begin="21.266" end="21.443">貧</span><span begin="21.443" end="21.868">乏</span></p><p begin="21.873" end="25.172" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.873" end="22.223">いらっ</span><span begin="22.223" end="22.654">しゃい</span><span begin="22.654" end="23.029">ませ</span> <span begin="23.159" end="23.605">ニンニク</span><span begin="23.605" end="23.913">増しで</span><span begin="23.913" end="24.423">目指した</span><span begin="24.423" end="24.867">健康</span><span begin="24.867" end="25.172">体</span></p><p begin="25.182" end="27.386" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.182" end="26.027">腹歌</span><span begin="26.027" end="26.523">満たし</span><span begin="26.560" end="26.919">て</span><span begin="26.919" end="27.386">る</span></p><p begin="28.654" end="32.048" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.654" end="29.822">優等生</span> <span begin="29.874" end="30.375">無知な</span><span begin="30.375" end="30.606">フリ</span><span begin="30.606" end="31.089">して</span><span begin="31.089" end="31.388">踊っ</span><span begin="31.388" end="31.632">ちゃっ</span><span begin="31.632" end="32.048">て</span></p><p begin="32.048" end="35.477" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.048" end="32.985">欠点</span><span begin="32.985" end="33.248">です</span> <span begin="33.336" end="34.117">現状把握</span><span begin="34.117" end="34.674">しちゃうから</span><span begin="34.674" end="35.097">中断</span><span begin="35.097" end="35.477">中</span></p><p begin="35.487" end="38.913" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.487" end="35.832">もう</span><span begin="35.832" end="36.687">譲渡</span> <span begin="36.734" end="37.201">見せびら</span><span begin="37.201" end="37.642">かし</span><span begin="37.642" end="38.073">合いましょ</span><span begin="38.073" end="38.669">劣等感</span><span begin="38.669" end="38.913">妄</span></p><p begin="38.923" end="41.688" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.923" end="39.659">変えられゃ</span><span begin="39.659" end="40.076">しないっ</span><span begin="40.184" end="40.309">て</span><span begin="40.309" end="41.187">わかってる</span><span begin="41.187" end="41.485">か</span><span begin="41.485" end="41.688">らぁ？</span></p></div><div begin="41.688" end="56.550"><p begin="41.688" end="45.215" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.688" end="42.137">直感</span><span begin="42.137" end="42.318">で</span><span begin="42.318" end="43.164">自己</span><span begin="43.164" end="43.548">中</span><span begin="43.548" end="43.723">な</span><span begin="43.723" end="44.228">理解</span><span begin="44.228" end="44.629">不能</span><span begin="44.629" end="45.215">プレイヤ</span></p><p begin="45.225" end="48.856" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.225" end="46.000">求</span><span begin="46.113" end="46.395">め</span><span begin="46.395" end="47.013">られた</span><span begin="47.013" end="47.472">なら</span><span begin="47.645" end="48.273">惨事</span><span begin="48.273" end="48.856">会</span></p><p begin="48.866" end="52.244" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.866" end="49.795">くだらん</span><span begin="49.795" end="50.792">口喧嘩</span><span begin="50.792" end="51.099">で</span><span begin="51.099" end="51.709">マシに</span><span begin="51.709" end="52.036">なん</span><span begin="52.036" end="52.244">だ</span></p><p begin="52.254" end="56.550" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.254" end="52.585">モッ</span><span begin="52.585" end="53.121">トー</span><span begin="53.153" end="53.403">もっ</span><span begin="53.403" end="53.860">と？</span><span begin="53.969" end="54.176">もう</span><span begin="54.176" end="54.654">意外と</span><span begin="54.654" end="54.810">辛</span><span begin="54.810" end="55.187">いの</span><span begin="55.187" end="56.550">に</span></p></div><div begin="58.223" end="1:12.700"><p begin="58.223" end="1:00.925" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.223" end="58.828">うざい</span><span begin="58.828" end="59.126">くらい</span> <span begin="59.126" end="59.572">叫</span><span begin="59.572" end="59.935">んだっ</span><span begin="59.935" end="1:00.142">て</span><span begin="1:00.142" end="1:00.777">喰らったっ</span><span begin="1:00.777" end="1:00.925">て</span></p><p begin="1:00.935" end="1:05.538" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.935" end="1:01.314">譲</span><span begin="1:01.314" end="1:01.871">れない</span><span begin="1:01.871" end="1:02.321">日々</span><span begin="1:02.321" end="1:02.613">よ</span> <span begin="1:02.705" end="1:03.337">栄養</span><span begin="1:03.337" end="1:03.562">に</span><span begin="1:03.562" end="1:04.341">なってまた</span> <span begin="1:04.341" end="1:04.655">汚</span><span begin="1:04.655" end="1:05.140">しあ</span><span begin="1:05.140" end="1:05.538">え</span></p><p begin="1:05.638" end="1:07.778" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.638" end="1:06.053">残機</span><span begin="1:06.053" end="1:06.460">わかん</span><span begin="1:06.460" end="1:06.915">なくて</span> <span begin="1:06.915" end="1:07.291">上がん</span><span begin="1:07.291" end="1:07.778">なくて</span></p><p begin="1:07.778" end="1:12.700" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.778" end="1:08.739">脊髄反射の</span><span begin="1:08.739" end="1:09.139">涙腺</span><span begin="1:09.139" end="1:09.422">は</span> <span begin="1:09.422" end="1:10.187">濁った</span><span begin="1:10.187" end="1:10.691">声</span><span begin="1:10.691" end="1:10.888">で</span><span begin="1:10.888" end="1:11.078">歌</span><span begin="1:11.078" end="1:11.231">えば</span><span begin="1:11.231" end="1:11.606">感謝</span><span begin="1:11.606" end="1:12.700">です</span></p></div><div begin="1:12.823" end="1:27.683"><p begin="1:12.823" end="1:16.760" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.823" end="1:13.710">試</span><span begin="1:13.710" end="1:14.126">し</span><span begin="1:14.126" end="1:14.614">たい</span><span begin="1:14.614" end="1:14.860">わ</span> <span begin="1:14.860" end="1:15.491">あたた</span><span begin="1:15.491" end="1:15.942">かく</span><span begin="1:15.942" end="1:16.760">て</span></p><p begin="1:16.338" end="1:20.000" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.338" end="1:17.201">絶体</span><span begin="1:17.201" end="1:17.849">絶命</span><span begin="1:17.849" end="1:18.270">な</span> <span begin="1:18.284" end="1:18.718">夜</span><span begin="1:18.718" end="1:18.953">は</span><span begin="1:18.953" end="1:19.333">気持</span><span begin="1:19.333" end="1:20.0